 end of the course for all participants</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"margin-top:16px;font-weight:700;\">General information</div><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Participants must be able to swim.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Bring suitable clothing, a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> and toiletries (e.g. shampoo).</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; There is a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> at the club.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Online training <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> are recommended.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> are available for course participants.</p></div></div>",
